{"id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-compositional-axioms.md","title":"编码量化的组合真理公理","display":"df-compositional-axioms — 编码量化的组合真理公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-compositional-axioms","aliases":["91-df-compositional-axioms"],"display":"df-compositional-axioms — 编码量化的组合真理公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-compositional-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-compositional-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compositional-axioms — 编码量化的组合真理公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(D)\\)</span> 是下述组合公理集；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> 标明组合公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 的一元谓词；所有编码操作与闭项量词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(a)\\equiv\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(a)\">\\(D(a)\\equiv\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(a)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是固定的算术公式缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(D)\\)</span> 为下面六个对象语言句子的集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&amp;T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a)];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\land T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\lor T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&amp;T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a)];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\land T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\lor T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&amp;D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>首行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 量化闭项编码，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,v\">\\(a,b,v\\)</span> 是普通数变量。这里量化所有内部句子编码；旧版只列每个标准公式的模式，无法支持原书关于非标准满足类和证明声性的结论。\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 替换类型限制得到 FS 的组合子句。原书 CT 不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\">\\(\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\\)</span>；若需要限制外延，可以另加该公理。\n量词右侧按原书遍历全部闭项；数码实例版本在没有相应正规性公理时不能默认为等价。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.3，印刷页 65–66，PDF 页 76–77；Definition 14.1，印刷页 145，PDF 页 156。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 是 $\\mathcal L_T$ 的一元谓词；所有编码操作与闭项量词见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"D(a)\\equiv\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\forall t\\quad&T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t);\\\\\n\\forall a\\quad&D(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a)];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&D(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{conj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\land T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\quad&D(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\to[T(\\operatorname{disj}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\lor T(b))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))];\\\\\n\\forall v\\forall a\\quad&D(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\to[T(\\operatorname{ex}(v,a))\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}).","display":true},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,v","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))","display":false}],"bytes":2366,"backlinks":[{"id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}$ 为 [[91-df-compositional-axioms]] 的六个编码量化公理。"},{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T})$ 为取消类型限制的六个组合公理，见 [[91-df-compositional-axioms]]。"},{"id":"0e138b4c93cfb69a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"